{"role":"assistant","content":"Fixed the Intervals.icu integration and documented the causes in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n- `static/app.js:28` — Connect now uses the authenticated API wrapper instead of an unauthenticated link.\n- `config.py:11` and `server.py:186` — OAuth scopes are now space-separated and correctly encoded.\n- `server.py:63` — Tokens without `expires_in` no longer receive an invented one-hour expiry; the refresh worker leaves them connected.\n- Existing expiry and refresh behavior remains for tokens that declare a lifetime.\n\nVerification passed using a loopback-only mock Intervals server, including the actual Connect button handler, OAuth callback, token exchange, wellness request, and refresh behavior. Python and JavaScript syntax checks also passed. No external services were contacted."}
